==Continuity==
In ''Shadow Fall'', the ''[[Temperance]]'' is described as an [[EF76 Nebulon-B escort frigate]], contrasting its appearance as an [[MC75 Star Cruiser]] in the [[Star Wars video games|video game]] ''[[Star Wars: Squadrons]]''.<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|the-temperance|The Temperance}}</ref> [[Lucasfilm Story Group]] executive [[Matt Martin]] clarified that the novel was in error and that it may be corrected in future printings.<ref name="Twitter">{{Twitter|missingwords|status/1275502478822305792|[[Matt Martin]]|quote=It should be an MC-75.|archivedate=20200623190404}}</ref>

